# Trivy ignore file for the kubeseal-webgui-ui image only.
#
# Intentionally empty: kubeseal-webgui-ui (built on cgr.dev/chainguard/nginx,
# Wolfi-based) scans at 0 findings. Kept as its own file (rather than sharing
# .trivyignore.api) because a plain Trivy ignore file suppresses a CVE ID
# globally across every image it is passed to. If this image ever needs a
# genuinely-unfixed-CVE exception, add it here following the same format and
# rules documented in .trivyignore.api's header.
